Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends},
         libparse-yapp-perl
Description: extensions for Parse::Yapp
 Parse::Eyapp is a collection of modules that extends Parse::Yapp: a
 bottom-up parser generator with named attributes, tree construction
 and tree transformations. It provides the eyapp and treereg commands.
 PacketFence uses it through Cisco::AccessList::Parser.
